.vercel
# The build now writes Vercel's Build Output API tree, which `.vercel` already
# covers. `/api/mcp.mjs` was the old target and no longer exists.

# Built MCP App view HTML — `scripts/build-ui.mjs` regenerates it.
src/ui/dist/

# Local previews — `scripts/preview-ui.mjs` regenerates them. Kept out of
# `src/ui/dist/` on purpose: the Vercel build copies that directory wholesale
# into the function bundle, so a preview left there would ship.
src/ui/dist-preview/
